   "answer": {
    "kind": "text",
    "value": "All the Kannada speaking areas came together on November 1, 1956 and the state of Mysore emerged. Later, this state was named Karnataka on November 1, 1973. Karnataka Rajyotsava is celebrated in memory of these."
